WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.050
- So what's like your craziest
experience with a fan?

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:07.250
- Craziest experience;
I'd probably say the time

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:09.230
a fan came up to me

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:13.200
and she asked me to write: love is love.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.250
And I, for some reason, I misspelled love

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:19.480
but she was gonna get
a tattoo on her wrist.

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:21.300
And I was like, "I'm so sorry."

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.190
And she's like, "No, no,
no, I'm gonna keep it."

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:26.760
So I haven't seen it today, but I'm sure

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:29.300
if you see someone that has love is love

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:30.850
with the love crossed out,

00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:33.930
that's probably my artwork.

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:35.230
- Oh my god, wait, so wait,

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:38.090
you ended up crossing out
the love; now it got cool.

00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:39.440
So love is dark.

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:43.500
It's a dark tattoo, mind you,
but I think it's cool, yeah.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:44.421
- Thank you.

00:00:44.421 --> 00:00:45.254
Yeah, I crossed it out

00:00:45.254 --> 00:00:47.610
and rewrote it and she was
like, "I'm gonna keep it."

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:49.560
And I was like, "Okay, cool, awesome."

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:51.450
- I get so nervous when people do that;

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:53.530
they ask me to do lyrics,

00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:54.730
and I don't know why I'm doing it.

00:00:54.730 --> 00:00:55.950
And then they're like, "I'm
gonna get it tattooed."

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:57.470
And I'm like, "I can't express to you

00:00:57.470 --> 00:01:00.000
how bad of an idea that is actually.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.420
Like, you shouldn't do that."

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:04.060
I was like, "You might hate
me one day. I'm just saying."

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:07.160
Like, you could be like,
"She sucks," and it's there.

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:07.993
Anyway-

00:01:07.993 --> 00:01:09.200
- It's so much pressure

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:11.500
'cause I'm like, "All right,
now it's 'do I do cursive?

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:13.940
Do I do box letters? What do I do?'"

